 ■ runner                                                                                                              ┃
   alpha                                    ~/alpha                                                                    ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                                               ┃
```

